    "title": "Mold is no match for Norwin High - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joseph Cramer ,\n1 days ago Before the start of school on Wednesday, August 20, many Norwin students were surrounded with confusion. The confusion came from the mold issues in the high school just prior to the start of the school year. Questions swirled on social media about whether the buildings would be ready in time? Would students be safe? Would students have to start the 2025-2026 school year online? Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
